Cell[TextData[{
 "The twisted differential is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{"1", ",", "1", ",", "0"}], 
     StyleBox["m", "TI"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{"1", ",", "1", ",", "0"}]], "+", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{"2", ",", "1", ",", "0"}]], 
    SubscriptBox["\[EmptySmallCircle]", "1"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{"1", ",", "0"}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"9d28d5a6-d4aa-49b3-adc1-bc123a18d6fb"],
 ": ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["CyclicHochschildDifferential"]], 
    "paclet:ChernSimons/ref/CyclicHochschildDifferential", 
    "ChernSimons Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "eb3a792a-2083-4897-8413-49289ac36b3f"],
 " of ",
 StyleBox["w", "TI"],
 " plus ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["CanonicalLieBracket"]], 
    "paclet:ChernSimons/ref/CanonicalLieBracket", 
    "ChernSimons Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "40b48cfe-726f-4f27-a2bd-ba547de1e9ec"],
 " of the part ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["m", "TI"], "[", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "0"}], "}"}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"3f6ff5f2-9167-4c0b-90d1-ba3163583fad"],
 " with ",
 StyleBox["w", "TI"],
 "."
}], "Notes",
 CellFrameLabels->{{Inherited, Inherited}, {Inherited, 
    Cell[
     TextData[{
      "26.09.30: Design review - the twisted differential takes the whole \
MaurerCartanElement and reads its part m_{1,0} and its pairing from it, so it \
takes no pairing argument (design 2 of the names doc, R5d, kept by Pavel); \
before R5d it took a BD action and a pairing, and a BD action in place of the \
element now returns unevaluated. Only m_{1,0} enters, as in q^m_{110} = \
q_{110} + q_{210} o_1 m_{10}. On a word the result is the same in both \
conventions, because the sign exponents of the two pictures differ by 2|m|; \
on a product the head must be that of the convention, and a product of the \
other kind returns unevaluated rather than being coerced, as for \
CanonicalLieBracket. The extension to products is the derivation extension \
CyclicHochschildDifferential and CanonicalLieBracket use. Prior art: the \
Wolfram Language has no twisted string operations; the engine the \
verification suites load computes the same differential as \
q110Twisted[mcCanonical, -], a function of the bare BD action, and \
T12/paclet-twisted-operations pins this function against it on every word to \
length 5 in both conventions, T12/paclet-twisted-operations-on-products on \
products of two words. No alternative interface was recorded.", "\n\n", 
       Cell[
        BoxData[
         GridBox[{{
            Cell[
             BoxData[
              ButtonBox[
               DynamicBox[
                FEPrivate`FrontEndResource[
                "DocumentationToolsStrings", "Edit"]], BaseStyle -> 
               "TextAnnotationButton"]]], 
            StyleBox[
             RowBox[{
               DynamicBox[
                FEPrivate`FrontEndResource[
                "DocumentationToolsStrings", "LastAnnotator"]], "pavel"}], 
             "TextAnnotator"], 
            Cell[
             BoxData[
              ButtonBox[
               DynamicBox[
                FEPrivate`FrontEndResource[
                "DocumentationToolsStrings", "Delete"]], BaseStyle -> 
               "TextAnnotationRemoveButton"]]], ""}}, 
          GridBoxAlignment -> {
           "Columns" -> {Left, Left, Right, Right}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}, 
          GridBoxItemSize -> {"Columns" -> {
              Scaled[0.15], 
              Scaled[0.68], 
              Scaled[0.15], 
              Scaled[0.02]}}]]], "\n"}], "TextAnnotation", 
     CellSize -> {590, Inherited}]}},
 CellTags->"TextAnnotation",
 CellID->622167612,ExpressionUUID->"6e4bf317-0dec-460f-950b-71094aa61dd1"],

